#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-messwerte->description
msgid ""
"Shown: tick or untick. Order: select a row and move it with the arrows. "
"Custom label: double-click the row; leave empty for the default. Values "
"without a sensor are not displayed on this machine."
msgstr ""

