#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-quellen->description
msgid ""
"Sets which network interface DOWN/UP reports and which drive FREE reports. "
"Only local drives are offered — a network share that cannot be reached could"
" block the interface. A USB stick plugged in later appears after “Detect "
"hardware again”."
msgstr ""

